{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"locally-discrete-bicategory","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"Locally Discrete Bicategory"}]},"title_text":"Locally Discrete Bicategory","kind":"definition","taxon":null,"url":"locally-discrete-bicategory.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"env","attrs":[["entry","locally-discrete-bicategory"],["kind","definition"],["label","Definition"],["numbered","true"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Every "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"category","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"category"}]}},{"Text":" "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" is a "},{"EntryLink":{"id":"bicategory","label":null,"body":[{"Text":"bicategory"}]}},{"Text":" "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"LD\")(cal(C))"}},{"Text":" with only identity 2-cells. Its 0-cells are the objects of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":", and the hom-category "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"LD\")(cal(C))(x, y)"}},{"Text":" is the discrete category on the set "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C) (x, y)"}},{"Text":": a 2-cell "},{"Math":{"src":"f => g"}},{"Text":" is a proof that "},{"Math":{"src":"f =\ng"}},{"Text":". Composition and identities are those of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":"; the unitors and associator are the unit and associativity laws of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":". Since the homs of "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":" are sets, any two parallel 2-cells are equal, so the triangle and pentagon hold trivially."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"A functor "},{"Math":{"src":"F : cal(C) -> cal(D)"}},{"Text":" gives a pseudofunctor "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"LD\")(F)\n: sans(\"LD\")(cal(C)) -> sans(\"LD\")(cal(D))"}},{"Text":", whose comparison 2-cells are the functor laws of "},{"Math":{"src":"F"}},{"Text":"."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"The locally discrete bicategory is how ordinary indexed categories enter bicategorical language: a "},{"Span":{"role":"","attrs":[],"body":[{"Text":"prestack"}]}},{"Text":" on "},{"Math":{"src":"sans(\"LD\")(cal(C))"}},{"Text":" is a pseudofunctor "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)^\"op\" -> sans(\"CAT\")"}},{"Text":", and its "},{"Span":{"role":"","attrs":[],"body":[{"Text":"Grothendieck construction"}]}},{"Text":" is a displayed category over "},{"Math":{"src":"cal(C)"}},{"Text":"."}]}]}}}]}}
